    "enterFiles": "DrCallbackImpl.doOpenDrMediaList -> switchModePlayback (3001 par=2), which stops loop recording",
    "disconnect": "DeviceKit.disConnect stops heartbeat, notify socket, and bindProcessToNetwork(null). It does not itself send 2001; the activity pause does.",
    "processDeath": "No dedicated dashcam command in a sticky service. OEM plugins stop the heartbeat in disConnect. Novatek also drops TCP 3333. Firmware then times out back to recording. The rebuild sends the explicit resume sequence from a connectedDevice foreground service onTaskRemoved/onDestroy."
